# Trinqa tokens

Source of truth: Home, Wallet, Earn, Activity.

- Import `typography`, `spacing`, `radius`, `colors`, `motion` from `@/theme` or `@trinqa/tokens`.
- Type roles: `pageTitle 30`, `amountHero 32`, `amountDisplay 25`, `amountCurrency 22` (Title 2 hero), `sectionTitle 17` (header / primary CTA), `kicker 16` (section name), `label 15` (row title, list amount, currency beside 22), `body 14` (supporting sentence), `caption 13`, `footnote 12` (hero label, date), `fine 11` (status), `micro 10`.
- Weights: medium / semibold / bold only. RN StyleSheet uses `typeWeightRn` (`500/600/700`). Do not use regular/400.
- Home hierarchy: hero label `footnote`, currency `label`, amount `amountCurrency`; section `kicker` semibold; rows `label`/`footnote`; status `fine`.
- Status: `colors.success` `#20AD2B`, `colors.danger` `#FF3B30`, `colors.pending` `#787878`. Never use named `'red'`/`'green'`.
- Surfaces stay the extracted stack: canvas `#F3F3F3`, elevated `surface` `#FFFFFF`, muted `surfaceSecondary` `#F5F5F5`, inset `surfaceLayer` `#F2F2F2`. Do not flatten this by painting buttons with the muted fill.
- No pure black `#000000`. Ink is `#111111`.
- CTA cyan (`colors.action*`) is excluded from palette work. Do not replace it with a new brand color.
- Do not add new font sizes, hex values, or radii in screens. Wallet illustration colors stay in `walletColors`.
- Native navigation, BottomSheet, and tab motion stay system-owned. Use `motion.press|selection|contentChange|processing` only for micro-motion.
